{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 3873464,
  "courseSlug": "nextjs-react-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Next.js & React - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43341140",
      "title": "Theory: How Does User Authentication Work?",
      "lectureOrder": 211,
      "videoOrder": 197,
      "sourceHash": "6ff0037866daf3da94cd052076e21cdb0f7b5a3948f69da12fd98ec147452920",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 1.11,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmuller] So we got",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.11,
          "end": 4.11,
          "en": "that user signup implemented, but as mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.11,
          "end": 9.11,
          "en": "that isn't really the authentication process yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.48,
          "end": 12.42,
          "en": "Instead, we want to make sure that users, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.42,
          "end": 16.89,
          "en": "can't visit /training if they didn't just log in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.89,
          "end": 19.59,
          "en": "so if they're not authorized.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.59,
          "end": 22.83,
          "en": "And therefore we need to answer one important question,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.83,
          "end": 26.25,
          "en": "how exactly does authentication work?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.25,
          "end": 29.343,
          "en": "What do we have to do as a next step?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.24,
          "end": 35.04,
          "en": "Well, in the end, authentication is a two part process,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.04,
          "end": 39.783,
          "en": "and the first part is that we must be able to log users in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.65,
          "end": 44.73,
          "en": "which in the end means that we wanna be able to verify",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.73,
          "end": 47.07,
          "en": "user credentials, email and password,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.07,
          "end": 48.48,
          "en": "check if they're valid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.48,
          "end": 50.67,
          "en": "if they match the ones that were used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.67,
          "end": 53.22,
          "en": "during account creation and,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.22,
          "end": 55.08,
          "en": "and that's very important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.08,
          "end": 57.84,
          "en": "we want to then mark a user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.84,
          "end": 62.84,
          "en": "who did provide valid credentials as authenticated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.85,
          "end": 65.85,
          "en": "We need some way of remembering",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.85,
          "end": 70.47,
          "en": "that this user who just sent this request is authenticated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.47,
          "end": 74.37,
          "en": "and should be granted access to protected resources,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.37,
          "end": 77.13,
          "en": "because that's the second part,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.13,
          "end": 81.75,
          "en": "that we have certain resources that should be protected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.75,
          "end": 84.53999999999999,
          "en": "and that should only be made accessible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.53999999999999,
          "end": 88.62,
          "en": "to authenticated users, to users who logged in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.62,
          "end": 91.263,
          "en": "and who are marked as authenticated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.61,
          "end": 94.92,
          "en": "Now let's start with that first part,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.92,
          "end": 99.42,
          "en": "logging users in and marking them as authenticated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 99.42,
          "end": 104.42,
          "en": "It all starts with a client, a user visiting our website,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 104.46000000000001,
          "end": 107.67,
          "en": "who in the end sends a request to our server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107.67,
          "end": 112.14,
          "en": "a request where they filled out that authentication form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 112.14,
          "end": 114.42,
          "en": "to either create a new user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 114.42,
          "end": 117.03,
          "en": "or to log in with an existing user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 117.03,
          "end": 119.52000000000001,
          "en": "and either way, they send some credentials",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 119.52000000000001,
          "end": 123.75,
          "en": "along with that request, because they submitted that form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 123.75,
          "end": 127.56,
          "en": "So they sent an email and a password to the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 127.56,
          "end": 130.95,
          "en": "On that server, we then verify those credentials,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 130.95,
          "end": 133.56,
          "en": "either because we just create a new user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.56,
          "end": 136.47,
          "en": "and we check whether we have a valid email,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.47,
          "end": 139.53,
          "en": "a valid password and the user doesn't exist yet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 139.53,
          "end": 142.05,
          "en": "or because the user tried to log in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 142.05,
          "end": 144.57,
          "en": "we take a look at the existing users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 144.57,
          "end": 146.46,
          "en": "that we stored in the database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.46,
          "end": 147.48,
          "en": "and we check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 147.48,
          "end": 149.82,
          "en": "whether that email password combination",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.82,
          "end": 152.103,
          "en": "that was submitted is valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.24,
          "end": 156.72,
          "en": "If we consider it valid, so if we determine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 156.72,
          "end": 159.81,
          "en": "that the user did provide correct credentials,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.81,
          "end": 163.41,
          "en": "we create a so-called authentication session,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.41,
          "end": 166.53,
          "en": "which in the end is simply a database entry",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.53,
          "end": 171.15,
          "en": "that's stored in a dedicated table on the server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 171.15,
          "end": 172.65,
          "en": "that's how we remember",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.65,
          "end": 176.57999999999998,
          "en": "that a certain user is now considered to be authenticated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 176.57999999999998,
          "end": 179.493,
          "en": "we store a new entry in a table.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 180.45,
          "end": 182.28,
          "en": "Now that entry, in a table,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 182.28,
          "end": 187.11,
          "en": "will in the end have an ID, a so-called session ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 187.11,
          "end": 190.32,
          "en": "and we then send back that ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 190.32,
          "end": 193.17,
          "en": "typically in a cookie, to the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 193.17,
          "end": 196.17000000000002,
          "en": "So the response to that authentication request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 196.17000000000002,
          "end": 198.21,
          "en": "to that login request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.21,
          "end": 200.76,
          "en": "contains such, a session cookie,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.76,
          "end": 203.25,
          "en": "a cookie with such a session ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 203.25,
          "end": 205.54,
          "en": "if the credentials were valid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 207.12,
          "end": 211.2,
          "en": "and the client, the browser, will then automatically store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 211.2,
          "end": 215.133,
          "en": "that session cookie, that's the first part.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 216.27,
          "end": 218.19,
          "en": "Now that we have this cookie,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 218.19,
          "end": 220.56,
          "en": "and now that we remembered on the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 220.56,
          "end": 224.4,
          "en": "that this user is considered to be authenticated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 224.4,
          "end": 226.29,
          "en": "we can move on to the second part,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 226.29,
          "end": 229.263,
          "en": "which is about accessing protected resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 230.4,
          "end": 233.1,
          "en": "Because let's now say a user who just logged in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 233.1,
          "end": 236.73,
          "en": "and who has that cookie now sends a request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 236.73,
          "end": 240.18,
          "en": "to some route that should be protected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 240.18,
          "end": 243.48,
          "en": "and we'll write some code that will protect the route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 243.48,
          "end": 246.393,
          "en": "and you will see how that works in that section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 247.47,
          "end": 249.54,
          "en": "What's important about that request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 249.54,
          "end": 254.54,
          "en": "is that the browser will automatically add cookies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 254.85,
          "end": 258.12,
          "en": "that belong to our website to those requests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 258.12,
          "end": 262.08,
          "en": "so that session cookie will automatically be attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 262.08,
          "end": 265.113,
          "en": "to that request and will be sent to the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 266.16,
          "end": 268.5,
          "en": "On the server, we can then take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 268.5,
          "end": 272.46,
          "en": "at that session cookie and verify its validity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 272.46,
          "end": 275.28,
          "en": "So if it in the end contains a session ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 275.28,
          "end": 280.14,
          "en": "we also have in our database, if it's a valid session id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 280.14,
          "end": 282.42,
          "en": "And therefore those session IDs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 282.42,
          "end": 285.57,
          "en": "also aren't just some kind of numbers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 285.57,
          "end": 288.36,
          "en": "but instead more complex strings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 288.36,
          "end": 290.403,
          "en": "that can't be easily made up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 292.14,
          "end": 294.87,
          "en": "Now, once we determined that we got a request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 294.87,
          "end": 298.23,
          "en": "with a valid active session cookie,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 298.23,
          "end": 301.77,
          "en": "we sent back the requested resource.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 301.77,
          "end": 305.43,
          "en": "So for example, the page content the user wanted to see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 305.43,
          "end": 307.86,
          "en": "or if the cookie doesn't look all right,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 307.86,
          "end": 310.53,
          "en": "if the session expired or something like that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 310.53,
          "end": 312.213,
          "en": "we send back an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 313.08,
          "end": 316.08,
          "en": "that's in the end how authentication works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 316.08,
          "end": 319.83299999999997,
          "en": "and that's what we'll now implement over the next lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
